"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0329-01-01:0":{"b": ["Ekbatana, Hamadan: Dola ya Achaemenid (Uajemi) → Dola Kuu ya İskender (ANTIK-ISKENDER-1113-B)", "7b1734be"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Ekbatana, Hamadan umiliki hupita kutoka Dola ya Achaemenid (Uajemi) hadi pengo lisilo na mmiliki. Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Nabonidus mwaka wa 6 (550/549): Kyros II anamshinda Astyages, anachukua Ekbatana, anapeleka hazina yake Anşan | Chanzo: Brown, S. C., \"Ecbatana\", Encyclopaedia Iranica VIII/1, 1997 (rev. 2011) | https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/ecbatana | «records that Cyrus II defeated Astyages, captured Ecbatana, and removed its treasury to Anshan»", "68589a0a"]},
