"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-2299-01-01:0":{"b": ["Umma, Ur: pengo lisilo na mmiliki → Dola ya Akkad", "25980168"], "d": ["Katika sehemu za Umma, Ur umiliki hupita kutoka pengo lisilo na mmiliki hadi Dola ya Akkad. Taarifa ya chanzo cha mpito: Sargon anamshinda Lugalzagesi; utawala wa Akkad unaanza kusini mwa Babeli (Jedwali 39: \"Sargonic period beginning in Babylonia\" ca. 2300, MC; MC II ca. 2292) | Chanzo: Sallaberger, W. & Schrakamp, I. (eds.) 2015, ARCANE III: History & Philology, Brepols (Kisim I; Kronolojia ya Kati=MC), uk. 90; Jedwali 39 uk. 136 | http://www.assyriologie.uni-muenchen.de/personen/professoren/sallaberger/publ_sallaberger/wasa_schrakamp_2015_arcane1.pdf | «he defeated Lugalzagesi of Uruk and thus became the only king of ", "c017226e"]},
